Description: NetBird mesh VPN client, systemd service
 NetBird connects devices into a private WireGuard network.
 Repack of the upstream release binary. riscv64 builds it from the
 release tag. The package ships a systemd unit and does not start a
 daemon in an image build chroot.
 Join a network: netbird up --setup-key <key>
